# The identity of site.contract.json, pinned.
#
# One payload line: <revision> <class>.
#
#   revision  the SHA-256, lowercase hex, over the RFC 8785 canonical
#             bytes of the document's PUBLIC projection. It moves when a
#             member a reader can observe moves, and only then.
#   class     how the change that produced this revision compares to the
#             one before it, by @jarenjs/contract's published rule table:
#             initial | neutral | additive | breaking | unknown.
#
# This file is a pin, not a cache: the website test suite recomputes both
# values and refuses a document edited without them. The update procedure
# is written down where the refusal is raised — test/website/site-contract.test.js.

28545db9211f17b97f817267e1b01d6abe1528e969d071bd69a8071e5924ca82 breaking
